026-11-24T10:20:03Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:20:05Z"},{"id":786550514,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4u4c7y","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":50878360,"digest":"sha256:fcdc39e0d2816cda40feeb579cd012321ffc5bd09ccd26f1dce73c3e2e916c3c","download_count":10,"created_at":"2026-11-24T09:39:35Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:39:37Z"},{"id":786746000,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4u5MqQ","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":13867,"digest":"sha256:987340c8bd0876d413c03bc2645f7a389a0134aea833414fd8d7d734bf0afbe1","download_count":461,"created_at":"2026-11-24T10:36:47Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:36:47Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- 代码片段支持导入和导出 JSON 文件 (contributed by @AndreasK79) (PR [#15554](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15554))\n- SQL 编辑器支持双击方括号或花括号选中括号内的内容 (contributed by @Acd-kk) (PR [#15589](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15589))\n- SQL 编辑器在光标位于嵌套语句内时按层级提供「执行当前层语句」候选 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#15513](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15513))\n- Shift+Delete / Ctrl+X 可剪切文档最后一行，行为与主流编辑器一致 (contributed by @AndreasK79) (PR [#15553](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15553))\n- 支持跳转到上次编辑位置 (contributed by @chukui2005) (PR [#15493](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15493))\n- 网格右键菜单可直接打开 BLOB 文本的预览 (contributed by @ThugKd) (PR [#15538](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15538))\n- Redis Stream 支持从最新条目开始倒序浏览 (contributed by @ThugKd) (PR [#15537](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15537))\n- Web 版 MySQL 连接可配置是否显示系统数据库 (contributed by @zhwq1216) (PR [#12582](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12582))\n- 多个本地 SQL 文件可批量设置数据源 (contributed by @ThugKd) (PR [#15543](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15543))\n\n### 改进\n\n- GaussDB 非 DWS 模式下从 pg_settings 读取并显示真实产品版本号 (contributed by @AndrewDi) (PR [#15570](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15570))\n- 数据库导出的 SQL 语句按表分组，便于按表执行和回滚 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#15521](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15521))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 表结构编辑器的下拉框不再因网格刷新意外关闭，滚动条悬停加粗更易辨认 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#15595](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15595))\n- PostgreSQL 数据传输重建表时不再因目标库存在同名索引或约束误报表不存在，避免级联误报 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#15337](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15337))\n- Doris 元数据查询避开不兼容的 information_schema 列并缓存 MySQL 兼容视图定义 (contributed by @Acd-kk) (PR [#15541](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15541))\n- Db2 目录注释存在无法解码的字符时不再导致读取失败，写入路径不受影响 (contributed by @bigdogcome) (PR [#15567](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15567))\n- MCP 插件工具调用遵循连接保存的传输层配置，不再回退直连 (contributed by @forthedreamhy) (PR [#15549](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15549))\n- MySQL 修改预览的 SET 子句读取同一语句中更早的赋值时拒绝生成预览，避免展示错误的前后对比 (contributed by @thejesh23) (PR [#15545](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/15545))\n","mentions_count":12}
